                                "sense_id": "100ad6b9-9a5a-34dd-b3ca-4e2e6c9480a7",
                                "text": "A damaged house is seen in Muji village, Akto County of northwest China's Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region, Nov. 26, 2016. About 130 herdsmen from Akto County, hit by a 6.7-magnitude earthquake Friday night, have been evacuated to a safer place, said local sources on Saturday.[...]\nAs of 6:50 am, another 100 tents, 300 quilts, 300 coats, 200 bags of flour, 200 tonnes of coal, small generators and flashlights reached Muji, where a villager was killed by a collapsed house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2749a84a-fc08-4765-9bfa-42bde3e71255",
                                "sense_id": "100ad6b9-9a5a-34dd-b3ca-4e2e6c9480a7",
                                "text": "Authorities are promoting the letter mainly in villages in border areas, such as Muji and Bulungkol in Akto (in Chinese, Aketao) county, he said."
